· Captionit"/><meta name="twitter:description" content="Generate word-timed captions for your video automatically, free and in your browser. 150 animated looks, 14 languages including Hindi and Hinglish, MP4 and SRT export, no watermark, nothing to install."/><meta name="twitter:image" content="https://www.captionit.in/twitter-image.jpg"/><link rel="icon" href="/favicon.ico?favicon.0ckg_w09q489x.ico" sizes="32x32" type="image/x-icon"/><link rel="icon" href="/icon.svg?icon.3b_ak8uwg1toh.svg" sizes="any" type="image/svg+xml"/><link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="/apple-icon.png?apple-icon.1zg5civk715du.png" sizes="180x180" type="image/png"/><script>(function(){try{
var hsh=location.hash||"",q=location.search||"";
