tion and the normal MP4 export, no. Speech recognition and rendering run inside your browser, so the video file is not sent anywhere for those. The file name, size, length and format are stored with your project, and your captions and transcripts are saved so you can reopen the project later. One exception: transparent overlay exports are rendered by the optional desktop Companion app, and that render does use the video from your project.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Which languages can it caption?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"14 languages: English, Hindi, Hinglish, Tamil, Telugu, Bengali, Marathi, Punjabi, Urdu, Spanish, French, German, Arabic and Portuguese. Hindi and Hinglish captions come out in Roman script, the way most creators type; Hindi in Devanagari script is a separate option.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Can I fix a word it heard wrong?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes. Every word is timed to the speech and every word is editable. Click a word, type the correction, and the timing stays. You can also shift all captions at once if the whole track is early or late.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What can I export?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"An MP4 with the captions burned in, ready to post on Reels, Shorts and TikTok; transparent overlay videos (MOV and WebM) rendered by the free desktop Companion app; and caption files (SRT, VTT, ASS, plain text and JSON) for YouTube, LinkedIn, Premiere, CapCut and other editors. MP4 export needs Chrome, Edge or Safari.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What can it not do?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"It transcribes what was actually said, so it cannot invent captions for silent video, and it will make mistakes on heavy background noise, overlapping speakers or very quiet speech. Fix those by editing the words. It is built for short video: free videos can be up to 5 minutes long, and the longest paid plan allows videos up to 3 hours.\"}}]}]"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"9:[\"$\",\"$1\",\"c\",{\"children\":[null,[[\"$\",\"script\",null,{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$11\"}}],\"$L12\"]]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"a:[\"$\",\"$1\",\"c\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"min-h-screen bg-[#141412] text-[#FFFFEB]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L13\",null,{}],[\"$\",\"main\",null,{\"id\":\"main-content\",\"className\":\"mx-auto max-w-3xl px-5 pb-24 pt-28 sm:pt-32\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-[#34D399]\",\"children\":\"Automatic captions\"}],[\"$\",\"h1\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 font-serif text-4xl font-semibold leading-[1.08] tracking-[-0.015em] sm:text-5xl\",\"children\":\"Automatic video caption generator\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-[#FFFFEB]/80\",\"children\":\"Drop in a short video and get captions timed to every word, in minutes, free and in your browser. Pick one of 150 animated looks, fix any word it heard wrong, and export an MP4 ready to post or a subtitle file for YouTube. Nothing to install, no watermark, and for transcription and the normal MP4 export your video file is never uploaded anywhere.\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L6\",null,{\"href\":\"/start\",\"className\":\"inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[#34D399] px-6 py-3 font-sora text-[14px] font-bold text-[#0B1512]\",\"children\":\"Start free\"}],[\"$\",\"$L6\",null,{\"href\":\"/pricing\",\"className\":\"inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-white/25 px-6 py-3 font-sora text-[14px] font-semibold text-[#FFFFEB]\",\"children\":\"See pricing\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-16\",\"aria-labelledby\":\"how-it-works\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,